  "intervention": "Qwen3-1.7B scores main token; strong-minus-weak logprob > 2; prompt repair and greedy replacement of 1 token with original token banned",
  "caveats": [
    "Math/BBH/AIME/Olympiad baseline scores use rule/symbolic graders; reprompt scores use GPT-4o-mini. Aggregate deltas are descriptive, not a matched-grader causal estimate.",
